				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:dmgoddsemnyljdrp4jgt4dam/bafkreiceamr3su5jnraffld424q2i5vw3dap5aei43qliywmg7glbm6exi"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-23T14:36:28.001Z",
			"content": "<p>If it's WordPress, <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:6z7y3krt7ze2tp5vtmanw4wb\">@roots.io</a> tools can help you keep it in version control, and this set of actions and workflows can help you make \"releases\" of the site (complete with database and uploads backup).</p>\n<p>These tools took moving WordPress sites from a week-long cross-your-fingers process to around 20min</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:dmgoddsemnyljdrp4jgt4dam/app.bsky.feed.post/3lptu5hywtk23",
