			},
			"date": "2025-05-23T15:04:16.583Z",
			"content": "<p>Oh hey, I totally forgot about this one. This should still work to ease the transition from a traditional WordPress site to a <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:6z7y3krt7ze2tp5vtmanw4wb\">@roots.io</a> Bedrock structure.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/MWDelaney/lithify\">github.com/MWDelaney/li...</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:4ro56gbge42enizovzvvw5sn/app.bsky.feed.post/3lptwuw7cck2d",
