				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:j22f6ka2ytwhnev7xllyeemx/bafkreiam2nmopkrilhj7bjxpby47b2osggbkap5v4eswjucokpsugm2va4"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-23T15:59:21.517Z",
			"content": "<p>What made you migrate from AWS and eventually drew you to Cloudflare? I am weighing options for web-hosting and it’s a bit overwhelming for a newbie.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:a64baelxsmvy6aonnbfhbirv/app.bsky.feed.post/3lpu3mmjhls2i",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tfedder.de/post/3lpu3mmjhls2i",
			"author": {
				"name": "Tobias Fedder",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/tfedder.de",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:a64baelxsmvy6aonnbfhbirv/bafkreigcjhsxk6uz4plibvdto6t23vicadmispnvgq2hlpj23x2fyilngy"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-23T16:50:26.835Z",
			"content": "<p>Excellent question! So I had to look up the TTL of my domain’s A record: 150 s.<br>\nOkay, okay, maybe add 15 min to set up a new server,<br>\nplus — obviously — the number of days until I notice my web site is down.</p>\n<p>Thanks <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:i3khfmz4tvrcu7fwrdoqr4u2\">@11ty.dev</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:v7iraphzme5vstlougdoc5cp/app.bsky.feed.post/3lpuc7zblyk2t",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/austingil.com/post/3lpuc7zblyk2t",
			"author": {
				"name": "Austin Gil",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/austingil.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:v7iraphzme5vstlougdoc5cp/bafkreihu4rbdtnz7fctlvpnk7q2yghnd6gprecare2uerftmrfswadbpza"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-23T18:48:40.193Z",
			"content": "<p>NGL, <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:atx24s5rfszl2w6qhhjsk4p6\">@coolify.io</a> makes it super easy. Probably within a day:<br>\n- Setup new host<br>\n- install coolify with 1 .sh command<br>\n- connect my git repo<br>\n- deploy</p>\n<p>I guess I'd also have to fiddle with dns, but <a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:dxdjdpz5ebvsjzxcm3j7xxsz\">@heyandras.dev</a> has done a real good job on this :)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
