			},
			"date": "2025-05-23T19:42:13.326Z",
			"content": "<p>a few minutes, depending on upload/download speeds and DNS</p>\n<p>only because my site is fully static since it was generated with 11ty! thanks for making such a cool thing, I love plain html and css, but it's such a pain to do everything manually without such a nice static site generator</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:y52xi2qdwcfsjkrno3aykkhc/app.bsky.feed.post/3lpuftz2u2s2l",
