			},
			"date": "2025-05-23T19:53:32.288Z",
			"content": "<p>A day, roughly. I know this because I had to when my previous host started redirecting URLs randomly to porn sites (!) I immediately bailed to Mythic Beasts, who I’ve been very happy with since :)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
