			},
			"date": "2025-05-23T20:05:47.413Z",
			"content": "<p>Yup. It was apparently upstream of them: my host used godaddy and they were the ones causing the problem. <a href=\"https://community.cloudflare.com/t/redirecting-to-unwanted-sites/445551\">community.cloudflare.com/t/redirectin...</a> has a record of it. But I was, not surprisingly, out the door as fast as my legs would carry me.</p>",
