			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/collinsworth.dev/post/3lpuoctt2u22s",
			"author": {
				"name": "Josh Collinsworth",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/collinsworth.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:dr7ktxokjqc2suwnook4k73h/bafkreigotpy47tpnxj2sptza4bsjtdebl4dqyfk6ovvrb26prjpytiinjq"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-23T22:25:00.039Z",
			"content": "<p>Fun thought exercise. I'd have to rethink my contact form and find a new way to handle redirects, but aside from that (which wouldn't be a big deal), I could be moved in a lunch break, I think.</p>\n<p>Honestly I'd spend *way* more time figuring out where to move than actually doing it.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:5aggfgiwmdyopemacj7hj473/app.bsky.feed.post/3lpur6cxoec23",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/syllie.bsky.social/post/3lpur6cxoec23",
			"author": {
				"name": "Syllie",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/syllie.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:5aggfgiwmdyopemacj7hj473/bafkreieplsjbsybliwvbmdhzytwxj2dssikud4ev7vj32qidkjfwphdrb4"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-23T23:16:09.374Z",
			"content": "<p>Yes! It is something I discuss with my clients too. Prevent lock-in and choose wisely. There are still companies that offer a great 'first bill deal' and bet on it being too much of a hassle to leave so they rack up the pricing the next bill by 500% or more. At least separate services.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
