				"name": "John Allsopp",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/johnfallsopp.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:syq6rmmuepxy7vmd572bwyfu/bafkreiedz2afwulqhjlcyjzeg62dfu4zqwhyd7aznv6hpduxnxvtqb26ym"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-23T23:27:59.256Z",
			"content": "<p>the library of Alexandria for our time.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:nnn7hle65gspngcmwf4jar7w/app.bsky.feed.post/3lpuslx35q22n",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/bobmonsour.com/post/3lpuslx35q22n",
			"author": {
				"name": "Bob Monsour",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/bobmonsour.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:nnn7hle65gspngcmwf4jar7w/bafkreifo2mfr56qzeojg52yc7mjs54ba7pun5ywe4l63ya7mgt6ek2lc4a"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-23T23:41:40.409Z",
			"content": "<p>It would depend on how much time I need to spend pointing to new name servers.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:v7iraphzme5vstlougdoc5cp/app.bsky.feed.post/3lpuuqkw4p22t",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lpucqerub22l",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/austingil.com/post/3lpuuqkw4p22t",
			"author": {
				"name": "Austin Gil",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/austingil.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:v7iraphzme5vstlougdoc5cp/bafkreihu4rbdtnz7fctlvpnk7q2yghnd6gprecare2uerftmrfswadbpza"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-24T00:20:02.911Z",
			"content": "<p>Yeah, give it a try some time. It supports all sorts of run times too.</p>\n<p>I probably missed a step or two above, but in the theme or portability, when you own your own server and deployment software, it's really easy to move from one vps to another :)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:tki7vwlanxbwrz2er67eaeqa/app.bsky.feed.post/3lpvjhde45k2d",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:nnn7hle65gspngcmwf4jar7w/app.bsky.feed.post/3lpuslx35q22n",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/simoncox.com/post/3lpvjhde45k2d",
			"author": {
				"name": "SimonCox",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/simoncox.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:tki7vwlanxbwrz2er67eaeqa/bafkreiabali2634y2slw3yiixyfgxibw6qhnvmp6imzbvyuflezvkjg4em"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-24T06:30:41.574Z",
			"content": "<p>Exactly this. But I also still have some apache hosting I could ftp the site to in 5 mins and then do the switch, so loads of options. <br>\nNever felt this resilient before <a href=\"https://bsky.app/hashtag/11ty\">#11ty</a>.</p>\n<p>Also I am sort of interested in exploring a solar powered self hosted server one day for the shits and giggles.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:pzgvqg4ihnaihkrpmxqz5pu6/app.bsky.feed.post/3lpvlhsc3g224",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/bell.bz/post/3lpvlhsc3g224",
			"author": {
				"name": "Andy Bell",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/bell.bz",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:pzgvqg4ihnaihkrpmxqz5pu6/bafkreiaapdk2gfx55k2bvki4b3c4azfba5uae6ej43yrgqi3cjwxrvk4ie"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-24T07:06:44.720Z",
			"content": "<p>I reckon <a href=\"https://piccalil.li\">piccalil.li</a> could be in a new home and live within the hour because of cloudflare dns</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/app.bsky.feed.post/3lpvp3kzgxs2j",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mk.gg/post/3lpvp3kzgxs2j",
			"author": {
				"name": "Matt Kane",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mk.gg",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:uwbl4k3tza7eyjv3morkrld2/bafkreic4mwsbm2tmuonamj4jq4kcjofk35bwics2f4oorp57f3cdfusjwu"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-24T08:11:29.411Z",
			"content": "<p>This was one of the worst aspects of original Remix: switching hosts required replacing multiple files throughout the site. The best way was usually to create a whole new site from the new host's template and copy over the pages.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:w5kwr6fli3jwllz5w52a7esk/app.bsky.feed.post/3lpvplc2bm226",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zettberlin.bsky.social/post/3lpvplc2bm226",
			"author": {
				"name": "zettberlin",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zettberlin.bsky.social",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:w5kwr6fli3jwllz5w52a7esk/bafkreiavltqn6ak4lt5jwfatlicwxhrjq3ugifq7l3cjfx5q7p7z2jcl5i"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-24T08:20:16.873Z",
			"content": "<p>Whithin 30 minutes plus content download time...<br>\nEffectively migration of one of our sites at hand would thus take about 8h.</p>\n<p>We build web applications for planning, building and managing infrastructure and forestation, mapping, statistics, controlling etc...</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:z6uec3g7xgkvxpy442663waq/app.bsky.feed.post/3lpvrwpxfe22s",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/kilianvalkhof.com/post/3lpvrwpxfe22s",
