				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/matthiasott.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:go53xbllmkjw3vp65vmrcjol/bafkreieo5fnndyymyv3oatblyfrlnsz5ubl2jpyk6yj3qc6hab2i5pinri"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-28T14:24:34.800Z",
			"content": "<p>Also: how long would it take to *redesign* your site? <br>\n(Asking for a friend … 😂)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:3rr66t753ubid4tth7rltsre/app.bsky.feed.post/3lqag5tlc5s26",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/pierbover.com/post/3lqag5tlc5s26",
			"author": {
				"name": "Pier",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/pierbover.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:3rr66t753ubid4tth7rltsre/bafkreig2wz76y2juflrsjs5rq62kvkikvhngrawxzbnkbk3q35ffahtxpa"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-28T14:30:58.940Z",
			"content": "<p>Minutes for static sites. Just drag and drop and wait for DNS to propagate.</p>\n<p>Apps... it would depend on the app. Between hours and days. Usually just finding a new container hosting.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:3rr66t753ubid4tth7rltsre/app.bsky.feed.post/3lqag5udmi226",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:3rr66t753ubid4tth7rltsre/app.bsky.feed.post/3lqag5tlc5s26",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/pierbover.com/post/3lqag5udmi226",
			"author": {
				"name": "Pier",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/pierbover.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:3rr66t753ubid4tth7rltsre/bafkreig2wz76y2juflrsjs5rq62kvkikvhngrawxzbnkbk3q35ffahtxpa"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-28T14:30:58.941Z",
			"content": "<p>I do have a single app that is deeply coupled to Cloudflare Workers and KV and for that I have no answer.</p>\n<p>I was hoping Deno Deploy KV would be the answer but that's apparently gone now.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:lyew7bhze3doamzbv46mygfh/app.bsky.feed.post/3lqagefapdc2v",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/deadparrot.dev/post/3lqagefapdc2v",
			"author": {
				"name": "Stefan Baumgartner",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/deadparrot.dev",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:lyew7bhze3doamzbv46mygfh/bafkreiezirnbfjq63rfcm3h5aizgwiavqyss2qlzuruaktqsyatnsl4ogi"
			},
			"date": "2025-05-28T14:34:38.793Z",
			"content": "<p>Thanks to 11ty, Zach, I was able to move it to a new host within minutes, Zach, waiting for DNS to catch up, Zach.</p>\n<p>Multiple times.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
